  "limits": "The quote dataset records changes to best price or size, so newer deeper updates need not have identical message times to the last BBO. The admitted depth snapshot matched prices and amounts independently, was newer in both clocks than that matching BBO, and preceded the decision. A strictly better level in June completed the initial trade by the original limit. A later June source entry became passive because the venue moved during the source's sleep. July's close is priced at the observed best ask, leaving a possible unseen/queued remainder. The source never cancels either persistent order and updates its directional status independently of confirmation. Closing a historical ledger across these orders requires resting queue, reject and partial-fill state.",
